# Generated by the simulators and the analysis scripts. All of it is
# reproducible with:
#     python3 drive_tension.py && python3 reduce_specimen.py
# which is the same set ./clean.sh removes.
#
# The two figures are deliberately NOT ignored: specimen_reconstruction.png and
# gauge_forces.png are the validation evidence the README refers to, so they are
# tracked even though they are generated. Regenerate them before committing if
# the model or the gauge layout changes.

__pycache__/
*.pyc

dump.npz
bar_identified.npz
specimen.dat
specimen_reconstructed.dat
interface_force.dat
interface_force_lossless.dat
interface_force_lossless.png

# superseded output formats, in case an older revision is ever run here
eps.npy
force.npy
meta.npz
meta.npy
